# Closed ways and presets (issue #129): an untagged closed way, as left by
# drawing a closed shape, must be offered area presets (Building, Park, ...)
# in Change Feature Type, not only line presets.
#
# fixtures/closed-way-presets.osm: one untagged closed way 3001, a square
# centered on the viewport (40.7120, -74.0060). Its bottom edge is at about
# window (488, 461).

window 1200 800
load_osm docs/screenshots/fixtures/closed-way-presets.osm
viewport 40.7120 -74.0060 18
wait_idle 5s

click 488,461
wait_idle 2s
assert_selected way 3001
capture out/closed-way-presets-01-selected.png

# The picker's default list.
action ChangeFeatureType
wait_idle 2s
capture out/closed-way-presets-02-picker-default.png

# Searching for "building".
key b
key u
key i
key l
key d
key i
key n
key g
wait_idle 2s
capture out/closed-way-presets-03-picker-building.png

# Choose it: the way becomes a building (and shows as one in the panel).
key enter
wait_idle 2s
capture out/closed-way-presets-04-applied.png

log done
